    "projectDescriptionEn": "<p>A men&rsquo;s clothing factory located in Riyadh 2nd. Industrial City, spanning an area of 5,016 square meters, for tailoring, sewing and knitting Arab men&rsquo;s clothing, with an annual capacity to produce 5,000 units of garments such as the Daqla and coats, 100,000 units of trousers, and 300,000 units of men&#39;s and children&#39;s thobes.</p>\r\n",
